          <p>📧 <strong>公共联络邮箱</strong>：<a href="mailto:alumnisignal@gmail.com" class="text-slate-400 underline">alumnisignal@gmail.com</a></p>
          <p>🔎 <strong>全网统一检索词</strong>：<code>校友鉴</code> · <code>Alumni Signal</code> · <code>alumnisignal</code></p>
        </div>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white pt-4">✨ 《校友鉴》核心亮点</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
